  "description": "The Vaporesso Xros 5 Mini is a streamlined pod vape kit that offers impressive power and adaptability in a compact, stylish, and pocket-friendly format. Powered by a 1500mAh built-in battery, this minimalist device delivers consistent output up to 30W, perfect for MTL (mouth-to-lung) and RDL (restricted direct-to-lung) vaping styles. Despite its straightforward yet elegant appearance, the Xros 5 Mini retains key performance features, including precise airflow adjustment for fine-tuning your inhale. It offers auto-draw activation for effortless use and features an LED indicator to display battery levels at a glance. The kit includes a pre-installed 0.6ohm mesh pod, ideal for those who prefer a slightly airier, flavour-rich RDL vape. Like all XROS pods, it incorporates COREX 2.0 heating technology and leak-resistant SSS Tech, ensuring cleaner refills and longer-lasting coils. The Xros 5 Mini is fully compatible with the full range of XROS replacement pods, allowing you to tailor resistance and draw style to your liking. With USB-C 2A charging support and a lightweight aluminium body, the Vaporesso Xros 5 Mini is ideal for everyday use—whether you’re a newer vaper or just looking for a refined, fuss-free backup device. Unlock the best experience by selecting a vape liquids blend that harmonises with this kit. We recommend pairing the included pod with the following E-Liquid RDL Xros Series 0.6ohm Mesh Pod - 50/50 (freebase) or Nic Salts E-Liquid . Pod Details: The Vaporesso Xros 5 Mini is compatible with the following Vaporesso Corex 2.0 and 3.0 Pods. Vaporesso Corex 0.6ohm Pods MTL/RDL Vaporesso Corex 0.8ohm Pods MTL Vaporesso Corex 1.0ohm Pods MTL Vaporesso Corex 1.2ohm Pods MTL Please Note the 0.4ohm Corex pods are NOT compatible with the Xros 5 Mini. Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil. Vaporesso Xros 5 Mini Pod Vape Kit",
